Whether an integer is in a list of integers. The input is the pair [x xs]; the output is 1 if x is in xs, and 0 if not.
---

---
(lam p
  (letrec c (lam l
        (if (? l) 0 (if (= (head l) (head p)) 1 (c (tail l)))))
    (c (tail p))))
---
[2 [1 2 3 ~]] => 1 fuel 100000
[9 [1 2 3 ~]] => 0 fuel 100000
[1 ~] => 0 fuel 100000
